Support Reference No. 1:
Sample Title: 2. Get "Clear license" of old PC in WinActor 7.6.1
1. Select [Help] -> [Version].
2. Select [Clear license] and save the license-clearing ID.

*Please note that after clearing the license (step 2), WinActor will become inactive and can not be used anymore.
*The license-clearing ID is saved as [WinActorClearLic_xxxxxxxx.txt]
*Please refer [5.15.2 Clear license] from Office Robot Operating Manual


